    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the ocean through a child's eyes to confront the legendary Kraken in this amazing hand-drawn adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a wonderful underwater journey unlike any other! Guide a tiny fish through the mesmerizing depths of the ocean, from sun-drenched reefs to the eerie midnight zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a breathtaking underwater world brought to life by the vibrant, imaginative drawings of a 6-year-old artist. This isn't just a game, it's a journey of wonder and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Depths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse ocean regions: Sunlit Zone, Coral Reef, Twilight Zone, Midnight Zone, and the Mariana Trench. Feast on krill to grow bigger and stronger, then  battle fantastical fish from a child's imagination, each more bizarre than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On each level, confront colossal bosses guarding the depths, including the legendary Kraken!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique and Heartwarming Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn Art: Immerse yourself in a visually unique world created by a child's boundless imagination. Easy-to-learn controls with challenging encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of the deep and unravel the mysteries of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download now and embark on an unforgettable underwater adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the ocean through a child's eyes to confront the legendary Kraken in this amazing hand-drawn adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a wonderful underwater journey unlike any other! Guide a tiny fish through the mesmerizing depths of the ocean, from sun-drenched reefs to the eerie midnight zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a breathtaking underwater world brought to life by the vibrant, imaginative drawings of a 6-year-old artist. This isn't just a game, it's a journey of wonder and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Depths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse ocean regions: Sunlit Zone, Coral Reef, Twilight Zone, Midnight Zone, and the Mariana Trench. Feast on krill to grow bigger and stronger, then  battle fantastical fish from a child's imagination, each more bizarre than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On each level, confront colossal bosses guarding the depths, including the legendary Kraken!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique and Heartwarming Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn Art: Immerse yourself in a visually unique world created by a child's boundless imagination. Easy-to-learn controls with challenging encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of the deep and unravel the mysteries of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download now and embark on an unforgettable underwater adventure!</p>",
